        "cooked": "<p>Hi!</p><p><span>I just recently picked up a copy of the base game. &nbsp;My gaming group and I are loving this game. &nbsp;I've already downloaded Spiff's various accessories and just need to grab some card stock to print everything out. &nbsp;Before I head back down to the LFGS to pick up more expanions I saw that there's a new expansion coming out early next year. &nbsp;Considering GTG has done a kickstarter for every expansion so far is it safe to assume that Vengeance will also receive one? &nbsp;I know it was kind of part of the Shattered Timelines KS but, what can I say, I'm hoping to be able to get in on some wonderful promo action. &nbsp;;)</span></p>",
